# oracle: pair local/density alone, cut down from examples/PACKAGES/local_density/methanol_implicit_water/in.methanol_implicit_water: 2500 atoms, NVE for 10 steps (the table spline term of the example is left out; the per-atom check of local/density)
# measured max error vs native (per atom, relative to max(1,|value|)): 2.3e-14 (atom 1047 fz); thermo agrees at 1e-8.
# oracle-inputs: methanol_implicit_water.data methanol_implicit_water.localdensity.table
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           real
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      molecular
pair_style      local/density
read_data       methanol_implicit_water.data
velocity        all create  3.0000e+02 12142 rot yes dist gaussian
pair_coeff * * methanol_implicit_water.localdensity.table
timestep        1.0
thermo_style    custom step temp ke pe etotal evdwl
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
fix             timeintegration all nve
run             10
